#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:2
msgid "Downloads"
msgstr "Unduhan"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:5
msgid "User's Manual"
msgstr "Manual Pengguna"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :download:`CMUcam1 User's Manual <dl/CMUcamManual.pdf>` v2.00 for "
"firmware v1.12 is available in PDF form. It contains a parts list, board "
"schematic and software protocol description. Manuals for older versions of "
"the firmware can be found here: :download:`v1.11 <dl/CMUcamManual_1_8.pdf>`,"
" :download:`v1.1 <dl/CMUcamManual_1_4.pdf>`, :download:`v1.0 "
"<dl/CMUcamManual_1_11.pdf>`."
msgstr ""
":download:`Manual Pengguna CMUcam1 <dl/CMUcamManual.pdf>` v2.00 untuk "
"firmware v1.12 tersedia dalam bentuk PDF. Berisi daftar komponen, skema "
"papan dan deskripsi protokol perangkat lunak. Manual untuk versi firmware "
"yang lebih lama dapat ditemukan di sini: :download:`v1.11 "
"<dl/CMUcamManual_1_8.pdf>`, :download:`v1.1 <dl/CMUcamManual_1_4.pdf>`, "
":download:`v1.0 <dl/CMUcamManual_1_11.pdf>`."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:14
msgid ""
"If you decide to experiment with changing the camera register settings you "
"might also be interested in downloading the :download:`OV6620 Camera Manual "
"<dl/ov6620DSLF.pdf>` from `OmniVision <http://www.ovt.com>`__."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memutuskan untuk bereksperimen dengan mengubah pengaturan register"
" kamera, Anda mungkin juga tertarik untuk mengunduh :download:`Manual Kamera"
" OV6620 <dl/ov6620DSLF.pdf>` dari `OmniVision <http://www.ovt.com>`__."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:20
msgid "Building the Board"
msgstr "Membangun Papan"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you are building it yourself from scratch you will need to download this "
":download:`HEX code file <dl/CMUcam1_12.zip>` (containing the latest "
"firmware v1.12) to program the SX28 chip. This is the code which implements "
"the functionality and the serial protocol described in the manual. You can "
"obtain the `SX-Key <https://www.parallax.com/package/sx-key-usb-"
"downloads/>`__ downloader and application from `Parallax Inc. "
"<http://www.parallax.com>`__ Older :download:`versions <dl/code-"
"history.txt>` of the firmware can be found here: :download:`v1.11 "
"<dl/CMUcam1_11.zip>`, :download:`v1.1 <dl/CMUcam1_1.zip>`, :download:`v1.0 "
"<dl/CMUcam1_0.zip>`."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda membangunnya sendiri dari awal, Anda perlu mengunduh "
":download:`berkas kode HEX <dl/CMUcam1_12.zip>` ini (berisi firmware terbaru"
" v1.12) untuk memprogram chip SX28. Ini adalah kode yang mengimplementasikan"
" fungsionalitas dan protokol serial yang dijelaskan dalam manual. Anda dapat"
" memperoleh downloader dan aplikasi `SX-Key "
"<https://www.parallax.com/package/sx-key-usb-downloads/>`__ dari `Parallax "
"Inc. <http://www.parallax.com>`__ :download:`Versi <dl/code-history.txt>` "
"firmware yang lebih lama dapat ditemukan di sini: :download:`v1.11 "
"<dl/CMUcam1_11.zip>`, :download:`v1.1 <dl/CMUcam1_1.zip>`, :download:`v1.0 "
"<dl/CMUcam1_0.zip>`."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:33
msgid "Java Interface Program"
msgstr "Program Antarmuka Java"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:35
msgid ""
"We have an open source java program that you can download to interface with "
"and test your CMUcam1. This interface program allows you to track objects, "
"analyze data and grab complete CMUcam1 images. Here are :doc:`screenshots` "
"of this interface."
msgstr ""
"Kami memiliki program java open source yang dapat Anda unduh untuk "
"berinteraksi dengan dan menguji CMUcam1 Anda. Program antarmuka ini "
"memungkinkan Anda melacak objek, menganalisis data, dan mengambil gambar "
"CMUcam1 lengkap. Berikut adalah :doc:`screenshots` dari antarmuka ini."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:40
msgid ""
":download:`This is the zipped java project <dl/CMUcamGUI.tar.tar>` written "
"for Linux."
msgstr ""
":download:`Ini adalah proyek java yang di-zip <dl/CMUcamGUI.tar.tar>` yang "
"ditulis untuk Linux."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:43
msgid ""
":download:`This is the version of the GUI <dl/camGUI_1_1b.zip>` that auto-"
"detects your OS. It runs under UNIX systems that support serial IO as if it "
"were a file (such as Linux), as well as Windows 95/98/2000/NT/XP. We "
"recommend using at least a Pentium 2 400 MHz processor running Java 1.2.2 or"
" higher."
msgstr ""
":download:`Ini adalah versi GUI <dl/camGUI_1_1b.zip>` yang secara otomatis "
"mendeteksi OS Anda. Ini berjalan di sistem UNIX yang mendukung IO serial "
"seolah-olah itu adalah berkas (seperti Linux), maupun Windows "
"95/98/2000/NT/XP. Kami merekomendasikan menggunakan setidaknya prosesor "
"Pentium 2 400 MHz yang menjalankan Java 1.2.2 atau lebih tinggi."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:48
msgid ""
"To see examples of C code for the Cerebellum microprocessor and the BotBall "
"Handyboard communicating with the CMUcam1, go to `this web page "
"<http://www.cs.cmu.edu/~illah/ROBOCODE/index.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"Untuk melihat contoh kode C untuk mikroprosesor Cerebellum dan BotBall "
"Handyboard yang berkomunikasi dengan CMUcam1, pergi ke `halaman web ini "
"<http://www.cs.cmu.edu/~illah/ROBOCODE/index.html>`__."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:53
msgid "Schematic"
msgstr "Skematik"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:55
msgid ""
"Here is a high resolution JPEG of the current :download:`CMUcam1 Schematic "
"<img/CMUcam_schematic.jpg>` (board version 1.23)."
msgstr ""
"Berikut adalah JPEG resolusi tinggi dari :download:`Skematik CMUcam1 "
"<img/CMUcam_schematic.jpg>` saat ini (versi papan 1.23)."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/downloads.rst:59
msgid ""
"Before asking about the source code you might be interested in downloading "
"the :download:`SX28 Processor Manual <dl/SX-DDS-SX2028AC-16.pdf>` from "
"`Ubicom <http://www.ubicom.com>`__."
msgstr ""
"Sebelum bertanya tentang kode sumber, Anda mungkin tertarik untuk mengunduh "
":download:`Manual Prosesor SX28 <dl/SX-DDS-SX2028AC-16.pdf>` dari `Ubicom "
"<http://www.ubicom.com>`__."
